     ]
   },
   "note": "Rules 5, 6: the read (2 calls, 400 B) and the grep (1 call, 200 B) count -> reads 3, tokens 600 / 4 = 150; the list of docs/kb/ and the write of c.md count nowhere, so c.md is never opened and docs/kb/ has no search. Rule 7: one unit read, unitsTotal 3 and spend 10 pass through. Rule 9/10: the node has no ctxCost -> readsWithoutCost 3 and cost null (reads, none priced); files without reads have cost 0."},

