   "note": "Rule 8. Node 1: kbTokens = 4000/4 + 12000/4 = 4000, share 4000 / 40000 = 0.1, node cost 0.1 x 2 = 0.2. Node 2: kbTokens = 500 + 1500 = 2000, share 2000 / 8000 = 0.25, node cost 0.25 x 1.2 = 0.3. Rule 9, by tokens (not by calls): node 1 a.md 0.2 x 1000/4000 = 0.05, b.md 0.2 x 3000/4000 = 0.15; node 2 a.md 0.3 x 500/2000 = 0.075, the docs/kb/sub/ search 0.3 x 1500/2000 = 0.225. Rule 10: a.md 0.05 + 0.075 = 0.125; files 0.125 + 0.15 plus the search 0.225 = 0.5 = summary.cost."},

